B.a0u=new A.k8("What Roktosheba is","Roktosheba helps people find voluntary blood donors nearby. We do not collect, store or supply blood.")
B.a0o=new A.k8("Who can use it","You must be 18 or older. Donate only if you are healthy and meet the donation rules. The final decision is always made by the hospital or blood bank, not this app.")
